<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">1 TESALONIK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wu ɛ̃kwel ola baal a Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Te</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wu ɛ̃kwel ola baal a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃kwel ol'andoo ba Tesalonik, ntam Pool áswɛn ndɛ bvoo ye Silas bwɛn a Timote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). Obɔ otsɛn bɛn onse ɔ̃nkaan wu bɔ abeyɛɛn bibi ndir «bee». Bviil li Tesalonik éli buu e nsie yi Maseduaan ke nzal yi Edzwɛn.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu Ɛ̃sal mi Antam (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 17:1-4">Ɛ̃sa 17.1-4</ref></char>) ayɛɛn emfa ki étee Pool Nsia yi Ngesɛ ola baal ba bviil li Tesalonik. Onse baal b'ákiool Nsia oyɔ, Ayuda hɛ̃ áli. Kɛn Ayuda bakyɛ áluul me nsɔɔ. Bɔ ábvool baal bu álɔ ɛ̃tsab onse embuul ye tsungaa onse bviil. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn andoo a dzi me nsia b'ásuul Pool ábal tswa-a-tswa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ'étɔ Pool ke bviil li Kolɛ̃nte sua ɔ̃bvu wu ãku-ãtaan y'ɔ̃mɔ (51) wuo wu ãku-ãtaan ye mviaal (52), Timote wu éyuɔɔl Pool ke Tesalonik áyi a ndɛ ãnsia m'akiool b'okɔ.</para>
  <para style="io">Áyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri akiool ásɛn ãnã onse ɛ̃mbio mi émwɛɛn a bɔ.</para>
  <para style="io">Obobɔ, ãnsia omɔ̃ ã́wi Pool mpɛn yi abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ akiool (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:1-10">1.1-10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Emfa ki eyɛɛn ntam Pool me ndɔɔ a ɔ̃sal wi ési bɔ ke Tesalonik, ŋ'eswoo kwɛn ákekwee ndɛ okɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 2:1-12">2.1-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Kɛn a ndɛ bvool ábveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 2:13-3:13">2.13–3.13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ke mbee a ŋ'éswoo Pool akiool epfuũ bvi edzii Nziã (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4.1-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ndɛ áyɛɛl bɔ ãtee me ndɔɔ oyɛɛn b'otal akiool b'álaal twal onse epfu y'obvool o Mfam (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4.13–5.11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ãsiil, ndɛ álieel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ k'eli ye kɔɔ kwɛn akel byɛ wɛ» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:9">4.9</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:1">5.1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu oli y'ãndɔɔ bibi m'ãwɛɛl okiool o baal. Ebvɔɔn li nɔ̃nɔ̃ ŋã hɛ̃ ebvaan etsiɔ ndɛ me ndɔɔ ese y'owam b'akiool.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, ye Silibvɛ̃<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkuũ a Silibvɛ̃ yinkyɛ eli Silas.</char></note> bwɛn a Timote, ekel ebvɔɔn li Tesalonik li Nziã wu Taal ye Mfam Yeso Mãsia. Yɔɔl kwɛn nyiĩ ekal ye byɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn opi okal ye byɛ!<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omwiĩ y'okiool b'Afi-Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Ãlio mbueel, bee ebebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a byɛ bueel, bvool ebelɔ byɛ kɛn olɔ onse ãbuɛɛn ã bee. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Bee ebetsam me byɛ ke nkwel a Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ m'okiool o byɛ b'obesal, dzii e byɛ li ebesal, y'osɛ-mwiĩ o byɛ b'ofa onse kaã li kokɔ li ebeta byɛ me Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Andoo, bee eyɛɛ wɛn Nziã odzii byɛ bvool ásueel byɛ k'ekal ba ndɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi étee bee byɛ k'étɔ ola byɛ kɛn a m'ãyɛɛn ãtu wɛ, yɔ étɔ ola byɛ ye waan m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. Bee ebekiool bam wɛn Nsia yi Ngesɛ oyɔ eli yi taa-taa. Ngwanyã, byɛ eyɛɛ emfa ki ekal bee onse byɛ me ndɔɔ obvɛ o byɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Me b'otal byɛ, byɛ eluɛɛn kuul e bee ye ki Mfam, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ eyɔɔ Endɔɔ onse ãmpal bibi, y'esɛ ki ewi Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Obobɔ, byɛ eyii baal bɛn akiool bueel ba Maseduaan ye b'Akayi anɔɔn a kuul e byɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, fa ola byɛ Endɔɔ e Mfam etsɔɔn, ke kɛn a ke Maseduaan y'Akayi wɛ, kɛn a nsia a okiool o byɛ me Nziã etsɔɔn hɛ̃ ãmboo mbueel. M'emfa okyɛ, bee bvool yi eyɛɛn oŋɔ̃ pyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bam abeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ emfa ki eyɔɔ byɛ bee ŋ'eyi bee ola byɛ, y'emfa ki éyiri byɛ anziã b'etiɔ m'oya ola Nziã, kwɛn byɛ esa ɔ̃sal a ndɛ, ndɛ wu Nziã wa mwiĩ bvool wa taa-taa. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Byɛ ebekiaal kwɛn Yeso wu Muaan a ndɛ, afa ywel aya. Ndɛ wu éseel Nziã onse b'ákwi-ákwi. Ndɛ àbvuul bia-byɛ me mpuru a Nziã yi èyeya.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃sal a Pool ke Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Taa-taa, andoo, byam eyɛɛ wɛn oyɔɔ b'eyɔɔ byɛ bee k'oli bo ngwel wɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Byɛ bvool eyɛɛ wɛn, ke mbee a ŋ'emwɛn bee fool bvool enywɛn ɛ̃tswɛ ke Filipese, Nziã owi bee ãŋã m'etsal bee byɛ Nsia a ndɛ yi Ngesɛ onse ãmvel bibi. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mpɛn a ãtee ã bee ke me ndɔɔ yɛn bee eli onse odziɔɔn wɛ wuo eli onse ãndɔɔ mã mbiin wɛ, ke me ndɔɔ yɛn bee hɛ̃ ebii k'epfuru baal wɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Kɛn onge bɛn Nziã okie ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bee, ndɛ okiool k'awa bee Nsia a ndɛ yi Ngesɛ. Obobɔ, bee k'eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi esa baal esɛ wɛ, bee eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi ewa Nziã esɛ, ndɛ wu akie ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ baal. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Byɛ bvool eyɛɛ wɛn bee mwɛn-éndɛɛl kɛn eyɛɛn ãyɛɛn m'opɛɛn wɛ, bee mwɛn-éndɛɛl kɛn esi ãndɔɔ me ndɔɔ yi ebɔɔ nzi wɛ, Nziã ndyam oyɛɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Bee k'ebii lweel li efa ola baal wɛ, ekal li efa ola byɛ, ekal li efa ola bakyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Ke yam, onge bɛn bee eli antam a Mãsia, bee kɛn ekeeywɛɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ m'oywɛɛn. Kɛn a bee ekal y'efyɛ onse byɛ, onge ngoo wu akyab baan. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />M'emfa okyɛ, me ndɔɔ a dzii e bee me ndɔɔ a byɛ, bee k'ekeedzii k'ewa byɛ kɛn a Nsia yi Ngesɛ wɛ, bee ekeedzii k'ewa byɛ hɛ̃ elaã e bee-myam, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ al'ayii y'ɔ̃bvɛn bibi me ndɔɔ a bee. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Andoo, byɛ eyɛɛ ɔ̃sal ye fool li emwɛn bee: Bee esal tsia ye mwiĩ, kwɛn bee ebee pfuũ e mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ okal, ŋ'éketsal bee byɛ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Nziã. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Byam emwɛn, Nziã hɛ̃ omwɛn: Bee ekal onse byɛ b'akiool m'emfa ki ngesɛ, ye ki dzu ye ki eywɛn elyal. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Byɛ hɛ̃ eyɛɛ wɛn bee ekal ye ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ onge b'ekal tal ye baan. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Bee ewi byɛ luo, ewi byɛ mpɛn, bvool etam byɛ wɛn, edzuu m'emfa ki edzii Nziã, ndɛ wu ata byɛ mbel k'okwɛn o ndɛ ye lweel e ndɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bee hɛ̃ ebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn ãlio mbueel, me ndɔɔ yɛn ŋ'eyɔɔ byɛ Endɔɔ e Nziã li etee bee byɛ, byɛ k'eyɔɔ lɔ onge endɔɔ e baal wɛ, byɛ eyɔɔ lɔ m'emfa ki eli lɔ lam: Lɔ eli Endɔɔ e Nziã, lɔ ebesal onse byɛ b'akiool. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Andoo, byɛ eluɛɛn kuul ki ãbvɔɔn ã Nziã mã ke nsie yi Yude m'onse Yeso Mãsia: Byɛ emwɛn fool li etueel baal b'ɔ̃kiri a byam byɛ, emfa kiki hɛ̃ ãbvɔɔn ãmwɛn fool li etueel Ayuda mɔ̃. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Bɔ b'ábam Mfam Yeso y'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. Bɔ hɛ̃ b'atueel bee fool. Bɔ k'asa Nziã esɛ wɛ, bɔ ali ataal a baal bueel. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Bɔ abekii bee nkuul yi etee bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, kwɛn bɔ abvuul. M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ akool ãbi ã bɔ kɛn okool. Kɛn a mpuru a Nziã esiɛɛn m'obva nkal a bɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool odzii k'amwɛn Afi-Tesalonik bvool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Andoo, me b'otal bee, bee ekab nzuru ye byɛ kɛn a me lio etsi-tsiri. Byɛ eli lala ye mviil ã bee, ke y'ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bee wɛ. Bee esi mpɛn yam bibi me ndɔɔ yi emwɛn byɛ bvool, ke ngwel wɛ bee eli y'efua okyɛ kyam. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bee ekedzii k'eya ola byɛ, myam wu Pool nkie k'esa obobɔ nsa bibi, kɛn Ɔ̃pfu okii bee nkuul. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Obobɔ, kaã e bee m'anã? Esɛ e bee m'anã? Ekɔrɔ e bee ki lweel anã? Ke byɛ hɛ̃ ke nkwel a Mfam Yeso, ŋ'ekieel eya ndɛ wɛ? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ngwanyã, byɛ eli lweel y'esɛ e bee.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Obobɔ, onge bɛn bee ale k'ebekoo k'ekiaal wɛ, bee ekuru k'ekal bee myam k'Atɛn. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Bee bu eyuɔɔl ndoo a bee Timote, wu abesa ɔ̃sal a Nziã ye bee onse otsal o Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mãsia, kwɛn ndɛ awɛɛl byɛ bvool awa byɛ mpɛn onse okiool o byɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'aywɛn a mpɛn onse ãmpal mã nonɔ̃ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, byam eyɛɛ wɛn ãmpal omɔ̃ ãli hɛ̃ onse ãndɔɔ m'éyɛɛl Nziã me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ŋ'éli bee kɛn ola byɛ, bee élieel byɛ tsɔɔn wɛn bee ekieel emwɛn ãmpal, bee hɛ̃ emwɛn mɔ̃, byɛ eyɛɛ obobɔ. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, onge bɛn mɛ̃ ale k'ebekoo k'ekuru ɔ̃kwal bvool wɛ, mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl Timote oyebii nsia yi okiool o byɛ, me ndɔɔ yi atal okɛɛn nga-ɔ̃mbio k'ambio byɛ wɛ, bvool okɛɛn ɔ̃sal a bee k'ali wa ngwel wɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Kɛn a Timote ŋ'atɔ ola bee ŋ'efi ndɛ ola byɛ. Ndɛ owi bee nsia yi ngesɛ yi okiool o byɛ ye yi dzii e byɛ. Ndɛ olieel bee ndiri byɛ eli ãlio mbueel y'ãtsam mã ngesɛ m'ekwee me ndɔɔ a bee. Ndɛ bvool olieel bee ndiri byɛ edzii bam k'emwɛn bee bvool, bee hɛ̃ edzii bam obobɔ. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Andoo, m'emfa okyɛ, onse fool y'ãwua ã bee, bee ebɔɔ mpɛn me byɛ, me ndɔɔ okiool o byɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Meba, bee emwɛn kwɛn bee kɛn eli mwiĩ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ esɛn ãnã onse Mfam. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Emfa emã ki ebveel bee Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a byɛ, m'esɛ kieel ki eli a bee me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ke nkwel a Nziã a bee? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Tsia ye mwiĩ, bee ebebuɛɛn ndɛ y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ ndyam, kwɛn ndɛ awa bee nkuul yi emwɛn byɛ, bvool kwɛn bee ekool ndɔɔ yi eywɛn m'okiool o byɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ndyam bwɛn a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia afaal nkuul a bee tiil k'etɔ bee ola byɛ! <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Yɔɔl Mfam asa kwɛn dzii e byɛ eyi nkwel bvool ekal lam li enduru ɔ̃ndel me ndɔɔ a byam-a-byam, bvool me ndɔɔ a baal bueel, m'emfa e dzii li eli a bee me byɛ! <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ awa ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ mpɛn, kwɛn byɛ eywɛn elyal onse onsensal ke nkwel a Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ, ŋ'ekieel eya Mfam Yeso ye ba ndɛ bueel ba ngel! Amɛn!<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Epfuũ bvi edzii Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Andoo, byɛ eyio ola bee emfa kyɛn ebvaan byɛ ekal me ndɔɔ yi esa Nziã esɛ. Taa-taa, byɛ ebesa obobɔ. Kɛn a meba, bee esɔɔ ola byɛ bvool ewi byɛ luo me nkuũ a Mfam Yeso wɛn, esa b'onduru ɔ̃ndel. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byam eyɛɛ ãluo m'éwi bee byɛ me nkuũ a Mfam Yeso. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />B'edzii Nziã bɛn, byɛ ekal ba ngel. M'emfa okyɛ, ebee okal y'epfuũ ki abvool ntal ye mbuul wɛn byɛ kɛn ebaal bakyɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Yɔɔl kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ ayɛɛ k'asuaal ɔ̃kal onse onsensal bvool onse dzuun. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Ebee okiool kwɛn efua bvi ebi-ebi ekal y'okwɛn nkal a byɛ, onge b'ebesa baal b'ɛ̃kiri bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Yɔɔl kwɛn me b'otal ndɔɔ oyɔ, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ abee ndoo a ndɛ obi osa, wuo abee ndɛ opfuru. Ke ngwel wɛ, Mfam awa bueel b'asa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ etumbu. Bee tsɔɔn emeeyɛɛn byɛ yɔ, bvool bee efaal byɛ yɔ m'oyɛɛn. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã k'áti bia-byɛ mbel yi ekal onse ãndɔɔ mã mbiin wɛ, ndɛ áti bia-byɛ mbel yi ekal onse onsensal. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Obobɔ, wu abee m'etam bee osa mã, k'abee mbuul wɛ, ndɛ Nziã abee, ndɛ ndyam wu owi byɛ Ɔ̃fel a ndɛ wu Ɔ̃nsensal.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Me b'otal dzii li baan a Nziã, byɛ k'eli ye kɔɔ kwɛn akel byɛ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã ndyam amaayiool byɛ k'edzii bakyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Okyɛ emfa ki ebesa byɛ andoo bueel ba Maseduaan wueel. Andoo, kɛn a bee ewi byɛ luo wɛn, esa obobɔ bvool b'onduru ɔ̃ndel. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Onge b'elieel bee byɛ, esa mpɛn yi ekal onse opi, etal ãndɔɔ ã byam, esal me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ byam. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />M'emfa okyɛ, bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ awa byɛ dzuun, bvool byɛ k'ekal mpɛn me mbuul wɛ.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oya o Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Andoo, bee edzii kwɛn byɛ ebee onse odzɛɛn okal me b'otal b'alaal twal onse epfu. M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ k'èkal y'ãwua wɛ, onge baal bɛn kaã pyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn bia-byɛ ebekiool wɛn Yeso okwi bvool osiool, emfa kiki hɛ̃ me nkuul a ndɛ, Nziã hɛ̃ akieel abiri b'alaal twal onse ndɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Etal m'eyɛɛn bee byɛ, m'ãfi ola Mfam: Bia-byɛ b'ekieel ekal kɛn mwiĩ ŋ'ekieel eya Mfam, bia-byɛ k'ekieel etsɔɔn nkwel a b'alaal twal wɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'awi nkuul, nkii a mfam a ãnzwel ekieel ebiool, nkii a mvel-a-mvel a Nziã ekieel ebel, oŋɔ̃ Mfam ndyam akieel afa ywel asool. Obobɔ, b'ákwi-ákwi onse Mãsia akieel asiool ŋ'ɛ̃kwel. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bia-byɛ b'amwiĩ-amwiĩ b'esiil, akieel andɛɛl bia-byɛ eyi ywel mboo mɔ̃ ye bɔ onse epɛn, me ndɔɔ yi eyemwɛɛn ye Mfam ke ywel. Obobɔ, bia-byɛ ekieel ekal ɔ̃bu ye Mfam. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Obobɔ, ewɛɛl bakyɛ m'ãyɛɛn omɔ̃.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Onse okiaal o tsoo li èya Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Andoo, me b'otal ãlio y'ɛ̃bvu m'èya ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, byɛ k'eli ye kɔɔ kwɛn akel byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byam eyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn tsoo e Mfam ekieel eya enseel, onge b'eya mbuul a pfuul me tsia. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Ŋ'ekieel eyɛɛn baal ndiri: «Opi oli, kɔɔ-kɔɔ pyɛ», enseel oŋɔ̃ fool li kokɔ èyiool nkal a bɔ, onge mpal o buru yi eyoo ɔ̃kaal nga-yam. Bɔ kieel k'abvuul bam wɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Kɛn a byɛ, andoo, byɛ k'eli onse empeel wɛ, kwɛn tsoo olɔ eya enseel onse byɛ onge b'eya mbuul a pfuul. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ bueel eli baan b'okal-a-kal bvool baan ba mwiĩ. Bia-byɛ k'eli baal ba tsia wuo b'empeel wɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ ebee twal olaal onge b'elaal bakyɛ, kɛn ekal angɔ-mwiĩ bvool ebee ãndɔɔ y'enduul osa. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />B'alaal twal, alaal lɔ me tsia, b'ebɔɔ mbal, mɔ̃ ãbɔɔ bɔ me tsia. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Kɛn a bia-byɛ b'eli ba mwiĩ, ebee ãndɔɔ osa y'enduul. Elaal okiool ye dzii onge b'elaal mbwel-mbwel eluɔ ki bvieel ki efoo otwel. Elaal kaã li obvuul onge b'elaal mbwel-mbwel ekɔrɔ ki bvieel. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã k'áti bia-byɛ mbel kwɛn awa bia-byɛ etumbu wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ áti bia-byɛ mbel m'obɔɔ b'obvuul me Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Ndɛ wu Mãsia okwi me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ, kwɛn ekal ŋ'eli bia-byɛ mwiĩ, ekal ŋ'ekwi bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ ekal y'elaã mboo mɔ̃ ye ndɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Obobɔ, ewa bakyɛ mpɛn, bvool esa kwɛn bakyɛ akwel onse okiool, onge b'ebesa byɛ tsɔɔn.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãluo y'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl bo ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Andoo, bee esɔɔ ola byɛ wɛn ekal ye lweel me b'amwɛn fool m'ɔ̃sal onse byɛ, b'abebiri byɛ me nkuũ a Mfam, bvool abedzuru byɛ ãtswi. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Ewal bɔ ye bvɛɛ li nɛn bvool edzii bɔ me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal a bɔ. Ekal y'opi onse byam-a-byam. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Andoo, bee ewi byɛ luo wɛn, ewa b'abedzuu epwa ãnkunkwa, ewa b'emeesool nzuru mpɛn, ewuaal a b'ali y'okwal, ekal y'osɛ-mwiĩ ye baal bueel. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Ekal y'onkyab kwɛn mbuul abee obi obveel m'obi, kɛn ebii k'esa obvɛ ãlio mbueel onse byam-a-byam, bvool me baal bueel. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Ekal y'esɛ ãlio mbueel! <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Ebuɛɛn ãlio mbueel. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />M'ãndɔɔ mbueel, ebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, ke ngwel wɛ okyɛ emfa ki edzii ndɛ me ndɔɔ a byɛ onse Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Ebee ɔ̃sal wu Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal okii. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Ebee ãyɛɛn m'eyɛɛn aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ngwel owal, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />ebwɛɛl ãndɔɔ mbueel, ekwɛɛ mã ngesɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Obi bam okal ke bwɛn, ebee bɔ osa. <verse eid="1TH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Yɔɔl Nziã nga-opi ndyam asuul ɔ̃tsiin a byɛ wueel akal wa ngel. Yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ akwɛɛ ombuul o byɛ bueel, ɔ̃fel a byɛ, omwiĩ o byɛ ye nzuru a byɛ! M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ekieel eywɛn elyal ŋ'ekieel eya Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Wu oti byɛ mbel obvaan kwɛn alɔ ɔ̃kwal onse ndɛ: Ndɛ akieel asa ndɔɔ oyɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Andoo, ebuɛɛn hɛ̃ me bee. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Ebuun andoo bueel m'obuun bo ngel. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Mɛ̃ nduɔɔn byɛ me nkuũ a Mfam, yɔɔl kwɛn atsiɔ ɔ̃nkaan wu ke nkwel andoo bueel! <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Yɔɔl kwɛn nyiĩ a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia ekal ye byɛ!<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>